Package: kbdata
Title: Access Data from the Royal Danish Library
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("KUB Datalab", email = "kubdatalab@kb.dk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Search and retrieve aerial photographs, digital collection
    metadata, literary texts, and DR radio and television catalogue records
    from the Royal Danish Library. Return analysis-ready data frames, JSON
    responses, and XML documents.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/KUBDatalab/kbdata
BugReports: https://github.com/KUBDatalab/kbdata/issues
Imports:
    httr,
    jsonlite,
    utils,
    xml2
